         bare screenshot in a rounded rectangle. They also carry their own
         headlines, so they need enough width to stay legible - hence the
         larger sizing and the drop to a 2-up / 1-up on smaller screens
         rather than three cramped columns. -->
    <div class="proof-shots">
      <figure class="proof-shot proof-shot--offset">
