      <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6777561873" class="store-link">App Store ↗</a>
      <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.eyeswidewellness.whisp&pcampaignid=web_founders" class="store-link">Google Play ↗</a>
