      </div>
      <div class="outcome-card">
        <span class="outcome-mark">✦</span>
        <div><strong>See the threads between them</strong><span>Weekly reflections that draw your signs, dreams and entries into one picture.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-card">
        <span class="outcome-mark">✦</span>
        <div><strong>Dreams explored in depth</strong><span>Archetypes, recurring symbols, and how they echo what you notice awake.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-card">
        <span class="outcome-mark">✦</span>
        <div><strong>A picture for what a sign evokes</strong><span>AI-generated imagery, not a stock icon.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-card">
        <span class="outcome-mark">✦</span>
