      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q">Is the founders rate really locked?</summary>
        <p class="faq-a">Yes — as long as your subscription stays active, you keep paying the founders rate even after standard pricing rises. Cancelling and resubscribing later would be at whatever the current rate is then.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
